{%- comment -%}
  Product structured data for the Exhibit Record PDP.

  WHY THIS EXISTS: the live theme emits ProductGroup JSON-LD from Horizon's
  sections/product-information.liquid. The Crooks product template does not use
  that section, so publishing the redesign without this snippet would have
  DELETED every product rich result and all Google Shopping free-listing
  eligibility. This restores it from our own template.

  Shape follows Google's variant guidance: ProductGroup wrapping one Product per
  variant when the product has real options, a plain Product when it does not.
  Server-rendered in Liquid, never injected by JS, per Google's December 2025
  JS-SEO guidance.

  Every interpolated value goes through the `json` filter — Shopify's own
  escaper — so no title, description or option value can break the literal.

  NOT included, deliberately: aggregateRating/review (no reviews app is
  installed, and inventing ratings is both wrong and a manual action), and
  OfferShippingDetails (the rate card is tiered and country-dependent; wrong
  shipping data in schema is worse than none).

  GTIN (SEO audit 2026-09-30): variant barcodes on this store are internal
  8-digit labels (the last 8 digits of the variant ID), not GS1 GTINs. Declaring
  them as `gtin` tells Google they are real barcodes. `gtin` is now emitted only
  for a 12–14 digit numeric barcode (UPC/EAN/GTIN-14). Colour and size are
  emitted per variant from the product's own options.

  Promptd SEO/GEO audit (2026-10), findings G2, G8, G10:
  - brand and seller point at the site's Brand and Organization by @id, so the
    product, the label and the company resolve to one entity;
  - each Offer carries UK shippingDetails. The rates are the store's own UK
    Tracked 48 rates (Settings > Shipping and delivery, checked 2026-10-08):
    £3.00, free from £30. For a single item the cheapest UK rate is therefore
    £0 at £30 or more and £3.00 below. Handling 0-2 working days and transit
    1-2 working days are the shipping policy's own numbers. Emitted only when
    prices are in GBP. If the rates change, change crk_free_from and crk_rate.
    The returns policy is declared once, on the Organization (Google reads it
    for every product), so it is not repeated per offer;
  - material, country of origin, cut and care come from the product's own
    crooks.* metafields, the same values the Specification panel shows, and
    are left out when a product has none;
  - the description keeps a space between paragraphs (it read "Blue wash.14oz").
    A product with no description falls back to its own SEO description, and
    the property is left out when both are empty, instead of sending "".

  Accepts: product (required), breadcrumb_collection (optional).
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign crk_url = shop.url | append: product.url
  assign crk_desc = product.description | replace: '</p>', ' ' | replace: '<br>', ' ' | replace: '<br/>', ' ' | replace: '<br />', ' ' | replace: '</li>', ' ' | strip_html | strip_newlines | split: ' ' | join: ' ' | truncate: 320
  if crk_desc == blank
    assign crk_desc = product.metafields.global.description_tag | strip_html | strip_newlines | strip
  endif
  assign crk_brand = product.vendor | default: shop.name
  assign crk_org_id = shop.url | append: '#organization'

  assign crk_free_from = 3000
  assign crk_rate = '3.00'
  assign crk_gbp = false
  if cart.currency.iso_code == 'GBP'
    assign crk_gbp = true
  endif

  assign mf = product.metafields.crooks
  assign crk_origin = mf.origin.value | default: '' | strip
  assign crk_origin_country = ''
  if crk_origin != blank
    assign crk_origin_first = crk_origin | slice: 0, 8 | downcase
    if crk_origin_first == 'made in '
      assign crk_origin_country = crk_origin | slice: 8, 60 | strip | remove: '.'
    endif
  endif

  assign crk_images = ''
  for image in product.images limit: 5
    assign crk_img = image | image_url: width: 1600
    if forloop.first
      assign crk_images = crk_img
    else
      assign crk_images = crk_images | append: '|' | append: crk_img
    endif
  endfor
  assign crk_image_list = crk_images | split: '|'

  comment
    variesBy maps the product's own option names onto schema properties, so a
    catalogue that spells it "Colour" and "Color" both resolve.
  endcomment
  assign crk_varies = ''
  for opt in product.options_with_values
    assign crk_opt = opt.name | downcase
    assign crk_prop = ''
    if crk_opt contains 'size'
      assign crk_prop = 'https://schema.org/size'
    elsif crk_opt contains 'colour' or crk_opt contains 'color'
      assign crk_prop = 'https://schema.org/color'
    endif
    if crk_prop != ''
      if crk_varies == ''
        assign crk_varies = crk_prop
      else
        assign crk_varies = crk_varies | append: '|' | append: crk_prop
      endif
    endif
  endfor
  assign crk_varies_list = crk_varies | split: '|'

  assign crk_multi = true
  if product.variants.size == 1 and product.variants.first.title == 'Default Title'
    assign crk_multi = false
  endif
-%}

{%- capture crk_offers -%}
  {%- for variant in product.variants -%}
    {%- unless forloop.first -%},{%- endunless -%}
    {%- assign crk_avail = 'https://schema.org/OutOfStock' -%}
    {%- if variant.available -%}{%- assign crk_avail = 'https://schema.org/InStock' -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- assign crk_price = variant.price | money_without_currency | replace: ',', '' -%}
    {%- assign crk_bc = variant.barcode | strip -%}
    {%- assign crk_bc_rest = crk_bc | remove: '0' | remove: '1' | remove: '2' | remove: '3' | remove: '4' | remove: '5' | remove: '6' | remove: '7' | remove: '8' | remove: '9' -%}
    {
      "@type": "Product",
      "@id": {{ crk_url | append: '?variant=' | append: variant.id | json }},
      "name": {{ product.title | append: ' — ' | append: variant.title | json }},
      {% if variant.sku != blank %}"sku": {{ variant.sku | json }},{% endif %}
      {% if crk_bc.size >= 12 and crk_bc.size <= 14 and crk_bc_rest == '' %}"gtin": {{ crk_bc | json }},{% endif %}
      {%- for crk_o in product.options_with_values -%}
        {%- assign crk_on = crk_o.name | downcase -%}
        {%- if crk_on contains 'size' -%}"size": {{ variant.options[forloop.index0] | json }},
        {%- elsif crk_on contains 'colour' or crk_on contains 'color' -%}"color": {{ variant.options[forloop.index0] | json }},
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor %}
      {% if variant.image %}"image": {{ variant.image | image_url: width: 1600 | prepend: 'https:' | replace: 'https:https:', 'https:' | json }},{% endif %}
      "offers": {
        "@type": "Offer",
        "url": {{ crk_url | append: '?variant=' | append: variant.id | json }},
        "price": {{ crk_price | json }},
        "priceCurrency": {{ cart.currency.iso_code | json }},
        "availability": {{ crk_avail | json }},
        "itemCondition": "https://schema.org/NewCondition",
        "seller": { "@type": "Organization", "@id": {{ crk_org_id | json }}, "name": {{ shop.name | json }} }{% if crk_gbp %},
        "shippingDetails": {% render 'crooks-schema-shipping', price: variant.price, free_from: crk_free_from, rate: crk_rate %}{% endif %}
      }
    }
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endcapture -%}

<script type="application/ld+json">
{%- if crk_multi -%}
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "ProductGroup",
  "@id": {{ crk_url | append: '#product' | json }},
  "name": {{ product.title | json }},
  {% if crk_desc != blank %}"description": {{ crk_desc | json }},{% endif %}
  "url": {{ crk_url | json }},
  "productGroupID": {{ product.id | json }},
  "brand": { "@type": "Brand", {% if crk_brand == shop.name %}"@id": {{ shop.url | append: '#brand' | json }}, {% endif %}"name": {{ crk_brand | json }} },
  {% if product.type != blank %}"category": {{ product.type | json }},{% endif %}
  "image": [{% for src in crk_image_list %}{% unless forloop.first %},{% endunless %}{{ src | prepend: 'https:' | replace: 'https:https:', 'https:' | json }}{% endfor %}],
  {% if mf.fabric.value != blank %}"material": {{ mf.fabric.value | strip | json }},{% endif %}
  {% if crk_origin_country != blank %}"countryOfOrigin": { "@type": "Country", "name": {{ crk_origin_country | json }} },{% endif %}
  {% if mf.cut.value != blank or mf.care.value != blank %}"additionalProperty": [
    {%- if mf.cut.value != blank -%}{ "@type": "PropertyValue", "name": "Cut", "value": {{ mf.cut.value | strip | json }} }{%- endif -%}
    {%- if mf.cut.value != blank and mf.care.value != blank -%},{%- endif -%}
    {%- if mf.care.value != blank -%}{ "@type": "PropertyValue", "name": "Care", "value": {{ mf.care.value | strip_newlines | strip | json }} }{%- endif -%}
  ],{% endif %}
  {% if crk_varies_list.size > 0 %}"variesBy": [{% for v in crk_varies_list %}{% unless forloop.first %},{% endunless %}{{ v | json }}{% endfor %}],{% endif %}
  "hasVariant": [{{ crk_offers }}]
}
{%- else -%}
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "Product",
  "@id": {{ crk_url | append: '#product' | json }},
  "name": {{ product.title | json }},
  {% if crk_desc != blank %}"description": {{ crk_desc | json }},{% endif %}
  "url": {{ crk_url | json }},
  "brand": { "@type": "Brand", {% if crk_brand == shop.name %}"@id": {{ shop.url | append: '#brand' | json }}, {% endif %}"name": {{ crk_brand | json }} },
  {% if product.type != blank %}"category": {{ product.type | json }},{% endif %}
  {% if product.selected_or_first_available_variant.sku != blank %}"sku": {{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.sku | json }},{% endif %}
  "image": [{% for src in crk_image_list %}{% unless forloop.first %},{% endunless %}{{ src | prepend: 'https:' | replace: 'https:https:', 'https:' | json }}{% endfor %}],
  {% if mf.fabric.value != blank %}"material": {{ mf.fabric.value | strip | json }},{% endif %}
  {% if crk_origin_country != blank %}"countryOfOrigin": { "@type": "Country", "name": {{ crk_origin_country | json }} },{% endif %}
  {% if mf.cut.value != blank or mf.care.value != blank %}"additionalProperty": [
    {%- if mf.cut.value != blank -%}{ "@type": "PropertyValue", "name": "Cut", "value": {{ mf.cut.value | strip | json }} }{%- endif -%}
    {%- if mf.cut.value != blank and mf.care.value != blank -%},{%- endif -%}
    {%- if mf.care.value != blank -%}{ "@type": "PropertyValue", "name": "Care", "value": {{ mf.care.value | strip_newlines | strip | json }} }{%- endif -%}
  ],{% endif %}
  "offers": {
    "@type": "Offer",
    "url": {{ crk_url | json }},
    "price": {{ product.selected_or_first_available_variant.price | money_without_currency | replace: ',', '' | json }},
    "priceCurrency": {{ cart.currency.iso_code | json }},
    "availability": {% if product.available %}"https://schema.org/InStock"{% else %}"https://schema.org/OutOfStock"{% endif %},
    "itemCondition": "https://schema.org/NewCondition",
    "seller": { "@type": "Organization", "@id": {{ crk_org_id | json }}, "name": {{ shop.name | json }} }{% if crk_gbp %},
    "shippingDetails": {% render 'crooks-schema-shipping', price: product.selected_or_first_available_variant.price, free_from: crk_free_from, rate: crk_rate %}{% endif %}
  }
}
{%- endif -%}
</script>

{%- comment -%}
  Breadcrumb: Home > Collection > Product. `collection` is only set when the
  visitor arrived through one, so a direct landing (which is what a search
  result is) fell back to a two-level crumb. The product's own collections
  supply the middle level instead — skipping the catch-all ones, which describe
  nothing.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign crk_crumb = collection
  unless crk_crumb
    for c in product.collections
      comment
        "new-1" is a second NEW collection; a "what's new" list says nothing
        about what a product is, so neither stands in as its category.
      endcomment
      assign crk_h4 = c.handle | slice: 0, 4
      unless c.handle == 'all' or c.handle == 'frontpage' or c.handle == 'new' or crk_h4 == 'new-'
        assign crk_crumb = c
        break
      endunless
    endfor
  endunless
-%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "BreadcrumbList",
  "itemListElement": [
    { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 1, "name": "Home", "item": {{ shop.url | json }} }
    {%- if crk_crumb and crk_crumb.title != blank -%}
      ,{ "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": {{ crk_crumb.title | json }}, "item": {{ shop.url | append: crk_crumb.url | json }} },
      { "@type": "ListItem", "position": 3, "name": {{ product.title | json }}, "item": {{ crk_url | json }} }
    {%- else -%}
      ,{ "@type": "ListItem", "position": 2, "name": {{ product.title | json }}, "item": {{ crk_url | json }} }
    {%- endif -%}
  ]
}
</script>
